    "title_en": "On the Nature of $X(2370)$",
    "abstract_en": "Recently, the BESIII Collaboration claimed that their observed $X(2370)$ ($J^{PC}=0^{-+}$) is predominantly a glueball state based on several arguments. However, we find these arguments to be flawed and the conclusion unjustified. Instead, we demonstrate that all observed properties of the $X(2370)$ can be naturally explained by a $\\barΣΣ$ molecule dominated state.",
